        <detaileddescription>
<para>VariableToPointCloud</para>
<para>Outputs any element variable from CSMP to SKUA point cloud (ASCII table) format. Variables discretized on volume, surface or line elements will be output as point data placed on the barycenter of respective elements. <linebreak/>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>methods outputs coordinates in SKUA format where y=-z and z=-y </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
