        <detaileddescription>
<para>Enlists the unique &apos;element number&apos; values of elements for which NO_DATA values (-9999, -99999) were reported in the input file in the target region.</para>
<para>If the target region cannot be found of if there are no NO-DATA values in that region, the method returns false. Here, no-data values are expected for all the properties enlisted in the file header, e.g., rocktype, porosity and permeability.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>the input data file is expected to have the extension: &apos;&quot;-element_barycentres_properties.txt&quot;</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="author"><para>SKM </para>
